      "line" : 491,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 492,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "The Clans were established by the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom to..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 493,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Raffam, why were our ^3131FFclans^000000 made?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 496,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Raffam Oranpere]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 497,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Did you sleep in class? Gosh."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 498,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "The Clans help lone adventurers connect with each other and share information."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 501,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 502,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "A-ha, got it! Thank you, Captain!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 503,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "You heard that too, right?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 505,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 506,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Run by the Kingdom itself, the Clans are not allowed to participate in the Siege, but the good news is that the members are given some ^3131FFstat bonuses^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 508,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 509,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "In case you wonder if the ^3131FFCrossbow Clan^000000 only recruits Archers, no, it doesn't."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 510,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "All the Clans accept all classes. You can choose the one that suits your needs best."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 513,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 514,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "That should cover everything there is to know."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 515,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Berman, let's go hang out in Glast Heim."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 518,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Devon Aire]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 519,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "You..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 522,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 523,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Ooh, scary! You're so protective of your brother."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 526,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 527,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "The ^3131FFCrossbow Clan^000000 is ideal for ranged classes."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 529,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 530,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Eh, let me check the Clan manual. Ah, and we offer stat bonuses to new members: ^FF0000<DEX+1, AGI+1, MHP+30, MSP+10>^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 532,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 533,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "The Clans are not allowed to participate in the Siege; you should join a private guild instead for Siege."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 534,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "The Clans are for adventurers that hate being tied down."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 536,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 537,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Do you have a question?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 544,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 545,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Oh, yeah? Good choice!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 546,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Let's check the Clan policy then to begin admission procedures."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 548,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 549,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "^3131FFClansmen^000000 cannot participate in the Siege."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 550,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "As our new member, you'll receive the following stat bonuses: ^FF0000<DEX+1, AGI+1, MHP+30, MSP+10>^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 551,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Do you agree?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 553,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Yes."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 553,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "No."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 554,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 555,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "You can join and leave a Clan anytime, but if you don't login for ^FF0000more than 2 weeks^000000, you'll be ^FF0000expelled^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 556,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Do you promise you'll maintain good standing?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 558,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Yes."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 558,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "No."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 559,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "[Shaam Rumi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 560,
      "npc" : "Shaam Rumi",
      "text" : "Good, write your name here."
